@HD	VN:1.6	SO:unsorted
@SQ	SN:chr1	LN:40
@CO	0-based    0         1         2         3
@CO	           0123456789012345678901234567890123456789
@CO	chr1       ACGTTGCAAGGCCTTAGCATGCAATCGGATCCTAGGCTAA
@CO	Every record: 8M at 0-based 20..27, SEQ GCAATCGG (= reference), QUAL rising 10..17 left to right in SEQ.
@CO	Only FLAG differs. Walk strand = top iff is_last_in_template(0x80) == is_reverse(0x10).
@CO	f0: unpaired forward -> top
@CO	f16: unpaired reverse -> bottom
@CO	f65: R1 forward -> top (OT)
@CO	f81: R1 reverse -> bottom (OB)
@CO	f129: R2 forward -> bottom (CTOB); sequenced 5' end is the LEFTMOST base
@CO	f145: R2 reverse -> top (CTOT); sequenced 5' end is the RIGHTMOST base
@CO	f256: secondary: walked like any record
@CO	f2048: supplementary: walked like any record
